  "notes": "National Heritage List notes identify the clerestory, aisles, three-stage west tower, two tiers of lucarnes, apsidal chancel, transept rose windows and subsidiary turrets. The parish history and the contemporary Imperial Gazetteer put the steeple at 175 feet. The cleared Qualla view identifies the stone bands and general roof colors."
